  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 200 HEARINGS, APPEALS, AND WAIVER REQUESTS",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Env-Wt 200 HEARINGS, APPEALS, AND WAIVER REQUESTS\n\nREVISION NOTE #1:\n\nPursuant to a rules reorganization plan approved by the Director of the Office of Legislative Services on September 7, 2005, Department rules in Chapter Wt 200 filed under Document #8341, effective 4-25-05, were editorially renumbered subsequently with subtitle Env-Wt denoting the wetlands program area. The title Wt was discontinued.\n\nREVISION NOTE #2:\n\nDocument #12802, effective 12-15-19, readopted or readopted with amendment all of the rules in Chapter Env-Wt 200, and changed the chapter heading from “Rules of Practice and Procedure” to “Hearings, Appeals, and Waiver Requests.” Env-Wt 202.02, Env-Wt 203.01, Env-Wt 203.04, and Env-Wt 203.05 were new rules, which necessitated renumbering in Part Env-Wt 202 and Env-Wt 203 as indicated in the source notes.\n\nAs practice and procedure rules the rules in Chapter Env-Wt 200 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt200.html"
